    "translations": {
      "diagram.description.dataflow": "Four kinds of source feed the ingest. The manifest names each; knowledge-ingest.sh fetches what moved in a read-only job without an agent, and writes the mirror and a state per item in the lock. One pull request, refreshed until a person merges it, is the review; the Monday librarian names each concept whose mirror file moved, and a concept cites the mirror file and its origin."
    },
